      "passageLabel": "Dear Mum and Dad",
      "paragraphs": [
        [
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-1"
          },
          ". I haven't written before, but I've been ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-2"
          },
          " busy since I started. I'm ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-3"
          },
          " into my flat and enjoying the course so far. Lectures have started but I didn't ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-4"
          },
          " to be working so hard in the first month!"
        ],
        [
          "I've been a bit ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-5"
          },
          " this week. It's nothing to worry about but Rachel has changed course, so I'm now one of the few girls doing physics! I had a feeling she wasn't very happy, but I think she's sorted it ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-6"
          },
          " now."
        ],
        [
          "I ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-7"
          },
          " everyone but I'm making a lot of new friends. My flatmates are all ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-8"
          },
          " adventure sports (my idea of hell), but I had a go at climbing last weekend - exhausting but good fun."
        ],
        [
          "My next lecture is about to start, so I'll put this in the post. Give everyone a ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-9"
          },
          " from me."
        ],
        [
          "Lots of love"
        ],
        [
          "Rani"
        ],
        [
          "xx"
        ],
        [
          "P.S. If you don't ",
          {
            "questionId": "writing-4-10"
          },
          ", I won't ring you on my mobile. It's too expensive - but you can ring me!"
        ]
      ]
    },
